<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - APRIL 23.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - APRIL 23.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the main headlines reported by Kuku Radio on Wednesday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- The organisers of the Michael Jackson concert want to increase the amount of tickets to be sold from its present 80,000.</p>
<p>- The government wants to bring the tariff draft law in line with WTO and European Union requirements.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
